OL,3,GWales
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FOvernight,
OL,6,Fpatchy cloud and clear spells are
OL,7,Fexpected. A few very isolated showers
OL,8,Fmay feed into coasts, but most places
OL,9,Fwill remain dry. It will be a cool
OL,10,Fnight across the Wales, especially in
OL,11,Frural spots.
OL,12,
OL,13,CFriday:FAny morning showers will fade,
OL,14,Fleaving plenty of sunny spells through
OL,15,Fthe day. Sunshine may be hazy at
OL,16,Ftimes, but it will feel warm,
OL,17,Fespecially across southern Wales.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
